DeepJ ONNX

The DeepJ integration code is distributed under the repository's MIT license.

src/main/proto/onnx.proto is derived from the official ONNX v1.23.2
onnx/onnx.proto3 schema (https://github.com/onnx/onnx/tree/v1.23.2).
The two java_* options are the only schema changes; trailing blank lines
at the end of the file are trimmed.

src/main/resources/io/github/kirstenali/deepj/onnx/schemas.tsv is generated
from the official ONNX v1.23.2 operator schemas by tools/generate_schemas.py.

ONNX schema material and generated Java bindings are licensed under
Apache License 2.0. See LICENSE-ONNX.txt. The generated bindings are built
by Maven and are not checked into the repository.

Test fixtures are generated locally by the included scripts. Expected
outputs use ONNX Runtime 1.31.1 on CPU; runtime libraries are not bundled
or invoked by the Java implementation.
